WEBVTT

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:07.820
<i>He's fast!</i>

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:14.740
<i>He's tough.</i>

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:17.940
Olive drab, the color of soldiers!

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.330
As if you blue softies could damage me!

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.460
I dare you to say that again in Leonids territory!

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.000
Bell?!

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.940
I'm fine!

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.470
But two of them got away!

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.670
We don't go easy on crippled soldiers either!

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.190
We're cold, heartless soldiers!

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:52.110
If you like playing soldiers so much,
you should be wargaming in the real world.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.150
Very nice.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:05.950
Yeah.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:09.960
Territory battles have gotten much easier ever since Raker-san joined us.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:10.740
Yeah.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.330
And thanks to that, we can execute attacks like this.

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.880
Senpai, you're really close.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:18.340
There's no need to get embarrassed as avatars-

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:25.910
I'll handle the anti-air cannon guy.

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:26.640
Okay!

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:33.180
Go!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.170
Good work, everyone!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.080
Our territory battle win ratio today is 75%.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.060
It's the highest score we've ever gotten.

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:21.340
You feel so safe with Fuuko-neesan behind you.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:22.780
Indeed.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:26.410
Fuuko just won't agree to come here, though.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:27.900
We can't blame her.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:29.560
Shibuya is pretty far from here.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.590
Yeah.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.020
Haru, you're eating again?!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.410
Who cares?

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.530
We fought six battles today and I'm starving.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:43.400
But in the real world, barely 30 minutes
have passed since you had Mom's lasagna.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:46.020
We fought for half a day in the virtual world.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:49.750
Haru, there's something I want to check with you.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.900
Your results for last week's physical examination were okay, right?

00:03:54.720 --> 00:04:00.210
Yeah, I only got a message saying I have to get rechecked in two weeks' time.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.240
Huh?

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.680
Really, Haru?!

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.660
Um, yeah.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:09.080
That might be bad, Haruyuki-kun.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.520
How come?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.850
They implemented a score system for physical exams starting this year.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:21.660
Students unable to meet the standard are required to participate in a health-improvement program.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:22.610
E-Eh?

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.620
You didn't know? It said so in the message, Haru.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:40.070
I think I read it...

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.000
I bet you just ignored it.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.610
When you get a notice you don't like, you
pretend you didn't see it and forget about it.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:47.350
It happens all the time.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:49.250
N-No, it doesn't!

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.870
Nah, it does happen all the time, Haru.

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.440
Taku, you too?!

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:59.380
This really could be a problem though, Master.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:01.490
Yes, you're right.

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:03.070
What do you mean?

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:08.230
The health-improvement program takes place every Saturday from afternoon till night.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:11.990
What's more, you have to go to the clinic in your district.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.900
You'd be isolated from the globalnet.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.000
But that would mean...

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:22.200
If you end up in the program, you can no longer participate in the territory battles.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:24.840
N-No way!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.890
You're still eating?!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.100
It'd be such a waste not to!

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.310
This is a real problem though, Haru.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:36.390
You only have two choices.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:40.770
Get a better score in the re-examination two weeks later,

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:44.820
or give up and participate in the program.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.490
C-Can't I choose to keep everything as is?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.950
No. Too bad for you.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:57.250
Uh, so what exactly do I have to do
to improve my physical exam score?

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:00.700
I'm sure you already know, Haru.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.700
You're so hopeless.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:10.550
Haru, why don't we pretend you got tricked to let me handle the whole of next week?

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.440
I hate being tricked.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:14.920
Then pretend you got bitten by a dog.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.640
That's even worse!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:20.950
So you don't mind being unable to help out in territory battles?

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:23.070
O-Of course not...

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.530
Then you have no choice!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.040
Okay, Haru! Prepare yourself!

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:32.820
I, Chiyuri-san, who has tried every
method of slimming down under the sun,

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:37.050
will get you so slim that even
Silver Crow would be surprised!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:47.180
Normally, I'd increase the intensity of your
exercise bit by bit, but we only have two weeks.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:49.720
I'm gonna be pretty tough on you.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:50.840
Got that, Haru?

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.560
O-Okay.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.670
Do your best, Onii-chan.

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:58.020
Why are you guys here too?!

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:04.390
Well, when I heard that you were going to work hard to lose weight, I just had to come and see!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.070
Hard luck.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:21.330
No staring off!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.420
Two laps of the pool! Go!

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.050
What are you looking at?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:34.430
Well, I just thought maybe they grew a little.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.140
Compared to when we bathed together, that is.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.770
Th-That has nothing to do with you!

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.450
You're right.

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:42.940
Maybe I was just seeing things.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:44.540
Come on!

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:52.570
Anyway, in all seriousness, if your win ratio were to fall and Suginami went back to being a melee area,

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:54.910
it'd cause problems for us too.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:57.870
Make sure you train him hard.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.270
You've been working out for a week now,

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.790
but why have you only lost 300 grams?!

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:04.640
I want to know too!

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.190
Oh, Fuuko-neesan's calling.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.420
Haru, can we use your server to pick up?

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:14.490
Yeah.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.950
Hello. Have we made any progress?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.840
Not at all!

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:22.950
Haru won't lose any weight no matter what I try!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:26.110
That might be just how his body is.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:31.460
Some people put on weight even if they fast and drink only water.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.780
No way!

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.270
What now, Nee-san?

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:36.880
There's only a week left until the re-examination!

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.360
I have a plan.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:42.060
Can you leave this to me, Crow-san?

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:44.390
Huh? Leave it to you, Master?!

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:50.370
I know of a hot spring that can
improve your physical constitution.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:56.640
Why don't we go there for a weight loss training camp after this weekend's territory battle?

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:58.610
That particular hot spring, Fuuko?

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.910
Yes, that particular hot spring.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.040
You've been there before, Senpai?

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:07.580
Yes, it's actually quite a famous
hot spring among us Burst Linkers.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.080
By the way, it's a mixed-gender bath.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.630
What?!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:19.030
Ahh, the water's great!

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:20.090
Isn't it?

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:23.780
Haruyuki-kun and Takumu-kun, what are you doing?

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:25.750
W-Well...

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:26.630
NP.

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:29.100
This is a mixed-gender bath. No worries.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.760
That's right, Onii-chan!

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:32.500
Want me to scrub your back?

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.110
No, like I said...

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:37.320
Why must we bathe in our avatars?!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.930
Exactly!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.800
There's no point in bathing in our avatars!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:44.960
Oh? You were expecting something, Takkun?

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:47.640
Are you some sorta closet perv?

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:48.670
No!

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:52.540
I'm just asking if there's any point in
bathing in a hot spring in our avatars!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.500
Now, now.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:58.170
Keep carin' about the lil details and you'll go bald, Baldy!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.160
I'm not bald!

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.430
Ash-san, why are you here too?!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.100
I asked Ash to come.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.520
Ash heard you were having a hard time and wanted to come cheer you on.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:12.260
Master! That ain't what I meant!

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:14.450
Oh? Really?

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:20.400
I came 'ere ta watch you suffer and laugh at you!

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:23.870
Crowin'... over Crow!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:27.870
Mega cool!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:35.250
This hot spring is known for its ability to cure status ailments.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:40.800
Some status ailments remain even after you die and revive, right?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:45.260
You usually remove them with cures bought from an item store, but...

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:48.460
You get the same result bathing here.

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:50.360
We call it the "Healing Bath".

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.480
Oh?

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:59.190
This is also a hot spring in the real world.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:04.710
It's said to have slimming and
beautifying effects on your body.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:07.700
By the way, men and women bathe separately.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.130
Don't get any strange ideas.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:10.280
I'm not!

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:11.740
Why would we?!

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:13.170
Don't worry.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:19.590
I'll train him so hard that he won't have the energy to do anything of the sort.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.650
Damn, sounds like fun.

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:27.560
If I knew, I would've gotten permission to leave the campus and come here in the real world.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:30.100
Let's come here next time with everyone in the Legion.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:31.260
Yeah.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:39.730
Okay, first you'll fast until tomorrow starting tonight.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:44.630
But I haven't had a proper meal all week...

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:49.240
Use this chance to prepare your body for tomorrow's training.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.680
Got it?

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.050
Y-Yes.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.080
Um, Haruyuki-kun...

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:57.750
Yes?

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.900
Hang in there, Haruyuki-kun.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.470
Okay.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:17.840
Taku, I don't think I can make it...

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.780
Take care of things after I'm gone.

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:26.460
Oh, and please erase everything stored in my Linker and home server <i>without looking at them...</i>

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.780
You'll be fine. Just last out this week.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.020
Hang in there, Haru.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:45.580
So, what will you do tomorrow to get Haru to lose weight?

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:49.800
Indeed, you've already tried all kinds of methods in vain.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:53.510
So I figured I'd address the source of the problem.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:54.840
The source?

00:13:54.840 --> 00:14:00.000
Crow-san wasn't fat when he was in
kindergarten and early elementary school, right?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.070
Yes.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:04.950
He was handsome and secretly quite popular among the girls.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:07.990
Then why did he become fat?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:12.410
We should probably start by looking for the reason why.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.950
There's no way I can fall asleep tonight.

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:25.630
S-Sorry.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.020
That's my master for you.

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:48.970
She's really thorough.

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.990
Ooh, Tekken!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.150
Is it an early version?

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:59.330
I've never seen a running arcade version before!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.290
I wonder if it'll work...

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:08.890
Huh?

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:13.470
I've never played this before... right?

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:29.020
The reason he became fat, huh?

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:33.020
Oh, that reminds me...

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:43.250
The water's wonderful.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.960
Enjoy yourself.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.080
You were about to say something?

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.540
Oh, yes.

00:15:53.540 --> 00:16:00.190
I remembered that Haru started getting fat around the time his parents divorced.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.290
I guess I'm graduating.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.900
Time really flew by.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:10.070
But the bond between us won't change.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.590
Right, Haruyuki-kun?

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:15.640
Oh, what are you talking about, Senpai?

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.600
Haruyuki-kun, is that you?

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:23.420
Sorry, but I have no need for games anymore.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.880
I guess this is the end of our relationship, Senpai.

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:26.950
Haruyuki-kun!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:27.760
You're so cool!

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.510
Please go out with me!

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.440
How...

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.720
Congrats on your graduation.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.160
Bye.

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:37.260
Wait, Haruyuki-kun!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:40.390
I... I love...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.780
<i>That's right.</i>

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:11.310
<i>I played that game with my dad before.</i>

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:13.310
<i>But where?</i>

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.260
<i>Hang on, why did I forget about it until now?</i>

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:22.220
<i>Now that I think about it, my memories of that period are kinda fuzzy.</i>

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:37.050
Guess I still can't remember.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:38.230
Oh well.

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:41.570
Can't be anything important if I forgot about it.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.710
<i>Who's that?</i>

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:49.000
<i>Taku?</i>

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.770
S-Senpai?!

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.190
I-It's not what you think!

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:06.680
I'd never peek on girls bathing!

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:10.940
I-I know you're not the type to do that.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.750
A-Anyway, I'll get out.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.740
D-Don't worry, I didn't see anything.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.030
Bye!

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.410
Wait, Haruyuki-kun.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.940
It looks like we're the last two customers anyway.

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:29.710
I-If you promise me you won't look, I don't mind if you stay.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.920
But <i>I mind!</i>

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:34.420
Please. Just for a while.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.890
I have something to tell you.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:38.930
Senpai?

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:45.280
I'm sure you'd be quite handsome if you slimmed down.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:48.300
I won't stop you if you decide to lose weight.

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:50.890
Nah, there's no way...

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.550
But I'll be honest.

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:55.480
I'm scared of it happening.

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:02.080
The power of your duel avatar
comes from your mental wound.

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:06.870
Feelings of inferiority or unfulfilled desires during childhood become your strength.

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:10.680
But if they're resolved...

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:14.460
Or if you come to terms with them...

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:19.920
If you grow up, maybe you won't need acceleration anymore.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:23.790
I guess it's something to be happy about.

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:28.770
But part of me doesn't want to let you go.

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:33.790
I'm actually really greedy and selfish.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:35.780
You must be disgusted.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.780
I know that mental wounds are strength.

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:47.280
I understand that they gave me my wings.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:51.580
But even if I slim down, I won't change.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.710
I'll still fight for you.

00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:58.170
But...

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.320
Your wish is my wish.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:05.300
I became a Burst Linker just to grant it.

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:11.550
So until you're satisfied, until you say it's over,

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:13.310
my fight won't end.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:21.710
Then can I say something selfish?

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:25.740
Wh-Wh-What is it?!

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:29.120
No matter how you look, I'll still love you.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:33.690
So don't force yourself to change, Haruyuki-kun.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.100
Haruyuki-kun?

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.720
Hey, Haruyuki-kun?

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.390
Hang in there, Haruyuki-kun!

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:50.390
<i>I suddenly lost consciousness.</i>

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:58.000
<i>I was bedridden for a week from bathing for
far too long and trying too hard to lose weight.</i>

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:04.890
<i>But thanks to that, I passed the physical re-examination without a problem.</i>

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:11.160
Seriously, I don't know what's wrong with your body.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:14.220
You ate just a little and you're back to being fat again.

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:15.820
It really is a pity.

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:17.890
I had so much intensive training in mind, too.

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:19.200
Who cares?

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.170
I passed the examination and all.

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:22.400
Yeah.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:25.710
It's hard to imagine a slimmed-down Haru anyway.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:29.020
That's not nice, Taku.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.060
Everyone, they're here.

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:41.070
Well then, let's do this, Haruyuki-kun.

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:43.280
Yes, Senpai.

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:48.360
Nega Nebulus, attack!
